      <h2 id="what-title">What it is for</h2>
      <p>Finding accounting help usually means choosing between firms, directories and online filing services without a clear view of who does the work or what they are qualified to do.</p>
      <p class="para">AccountOrbit helps with that first step: working out what kind of professional your work calls for, and enquiring about an introduction where one is possible. The work itself stays with the professional you choose.</p>
      <p class="para">It also publishes plain explanations, so that you can make a better decision with or without us.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
      <p>AccountOrbit is owned by {{ site.owner.name }}. Personal profiles: {% ext site.owner.facebook, "Facebook" %} and {% ext site.owner.instagram, "Instagram" %}. These are personal accounts, not AccountOrbit company pages.</p>
      <p class="para">AccountOrbit is a referral platform, not a professional firm, so the professional you engage does the work and holds any qualification it requires. We publish only facts about the owner that are confirmed for publication.</p>
      <p class="para">Read more <a href="/about-me/">about Deepak Mittal</a>.</p>
